  "summary": "With over 16 years of professional experience, I've honed my expertise in full-stack infrastructure design and architecture, mastering the software development life cycle process. At HEB, my mission aligns with our dedication to innovation and excellence, contributing to a culture of continuous improvement. I bring a diverse perspective to our team, leveraging my extensive experience to drive forward-thinking solutions and strategic initiatives.\n\nMy role at HEB has positioned me as an effective leader in both technical realms and cross-functional team collaboration. I've spearheaded efforts in software prototyping, development, integration, and maintenance, ensuring the highest standards of quality and efficiency. My leadership in the Software Control Board reflects my commitment to meticulous requirements approval and risk mitigation, underpinning our success in delivering complex systems.",
